column1:
{"narrative": "I want to stress that this account is not mine, and I have no knowledge of its existence. Despite this, it is negatively affecting my creditworthiness, which could have serious implications for my financial future. 

I have taken the necessary steps to address this issue by contacting both the credit bureaus and LVNV FUNDING LLC directly to dispute the accuracy of this information. However, the erroneous reporting persists, and it is impacting my ability to access credit on fair terms. 

I hereby request that the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau investigate this matter promptly and take appropriate action to rectify the inaccurate reporting by LVNV FUNDING LLC. I also request that LVNV FUNDING LLC provide proof of the validity of this account and remove it from my credit report if they are unable to substantiate its legitimacy."}
